# {{.ProjectName}}

Generated from the `goplate` boilerplate. Echo + GORM + hexagonal architecture.

## Quick start

```bash
cp .env.example .env       # then edit DB_*, JWT_SECRET, ...
make dev                   # hot-reload server (requires air)
```

## Make targets

| Target              | Purpose                                           |
|---------------------|---------------------------------------------------|
| `make dev`          | Run the server with hot reload (air)              |
| `make build`        | Compile binary into `bin/api`                     |
| `make test`         | Run the full test suite with -race                |
| `make coverage`     | Generate `coverage.html`                          |
| `make lint`         | Run `golangci-lint`                               |
| `make swag`         | Regenerate Swagger annotations into `swagger/`    |
| `make migrate`      | Run GORM `AutoMigrate`                            |
| `make gen-feature`  | Scaffold a new feature (see `goplate new-feature --help`) |
| `make gen-adapter`  | Scaffold a new adapter                            |
| `make gen-event`    | Register a domain event                           |

## Layout

```
cmd/                       # main entry
config/                    # env-loaded Config
internal/
  server/                  # Echo wiring, Providers, subscribers
  middleware/              # JWT + error handler
  shared/                  # AppError, response helpers, validator
  events/                  # event bus + event types
  infra/database/          # GORM open + migrate
  features/                # business features (one dir per feature)
  adapters/                # external-service ports + providers
```

See https://github.com/haivh2111/goplate for the CLI documentation.
